Description: browser for S3 and S3-compatible object storage
 QBucket browses and manages buckets and objects on Amazon S3 and
 S3-compatible servers such as Hetzner Object Storage, Ceph RGW and Garage:
 uploads and downloads of any size (multipart, verified, resumable), copy and
 move between buckets, metadata, tags and ACLs, versions, bucket policy, CORS,
 lifecycle rules and object lock.
 .
 It is built for production data: every change gets a plan and a preview
 first, is verified afterwards and journaled; features the server does not
 support are detected and cannot be triggered; the window stays responsive
 with millions of objects. Secrets are kept in the system keychain (Secret
 Service or KWallet).
